Control</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">LCO properties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" width="700" href="../graphic/LCO_0000083865.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig><p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetAwsNetwork</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetAwsDevice</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol></menucascade> and double-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">LCO</uicontrol>.</p><p class="- topic/p ">In addition to
the common properties (Status and Fault Cause), this component has
these properties.</p><p class="- topic/p ">The Bacnet Load Control object allows external
control over the shedding of a load that it controls.</p></section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Poll Frequency</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list (defaults to <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">Normal</option>)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/OnDemandPollFrequency-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Object Id</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list and number (from 0 to 4194302)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/bacnetObjextId-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Object Name</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">text in the format <userinput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/userinput ">name.name.name.name</userinput> (default includes the entire component path in the station using
period (“/) delimiters between parent.child levels)</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetObjectName-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Object Type</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">drop-down list of BACnet objects</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetObjectType-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Present Value</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "><option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">true</option> (default) or <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">false</option></propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetPVConfigGp-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Status Flags</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">read-only indicator and check boxes</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetStatusFlags-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Event State</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">read-only</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetEventState-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Requested Shed Level</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Specifies the level of load shedding being requested. This value determines how much load should be reduced or curtailed by the load control object.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Start Time</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Configures when to begin.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Shed Duration</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">number (defaults to zero (0) )</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Configures shed duration.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Duty Window</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">number (defaults to zero (0) )</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Defines the time window  during which the load control object will operate in a duty-cycling mode. This window is used to control how long the load is allowed to be on or off during a load shedding event.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Enable</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "><option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">true</option> (default) or <option class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/option ">false</option></propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/Enabled-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Expected Shed Level</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "> Configured the anticipated or target level of load reduction that the LCO should achieve.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Actual Shed Level</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Provides real-time feedback on the current level of load shedding being achieved by the LCO.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Shed Levels</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "/><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Defines the possible discrete levels of load shedding that the LCO can implement.</propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Shed Level Descriptions</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue "/><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Provides descriptive text or labels for each of the defined shed levels. </propdesc></property></properties></refbody></reference>